The Translation Control Register TCR_EL1 defines the exact number of most significant bits that are checked. TCR_EL1 contains the size fields T0SZ[5:0] and T1SZ[5:0]. The integer in the field gives the number of the most significant bits that must be either all 0s or all 1s

