USB:
  (this classification is based on https://github.com/Chadderz121/csud)
  usbd            -- generic USB driver
  +--hub          -- USB Hub driver
  +--hid          -- Human-Interface Device driver
     +--kbd       -- Keyboard driver
     +--mouse     -- Mouse driver
  hcd             -- Host Controller Driver, hardware-specific
  |                  HCD implements an interface from usbd to hardware.
  +--dwc          -- DesignWare Core, RPi-specific USB OTG implementation
  CSUD lacks interrupt transfers, but Circle USB (https://github.com/rsta2/circle/tree/master/lib/usb) and uspi support interrupts.


